# change-class rules for ~/agents (T1399): <glob> <class>, first match wins; unmatched files are class full.
*.md docs
.change-classes docs
KB/* docs
bin/tests/* logic
bin/* logic
lib/* logic
units/* logic
dashboard/* logic
